Are you a hospitality professional who enjoys taking the lead during a busy shift? Do you keep a cool head when the terrace is full, the bar is busy and guests need your attention at the same time? And do you enjoy coaching a team on the floor while actively working alongside them? Then we are looking for you as our Shiftleader Food & Beverage at SnowWorld Amsterdam! 
A day on the slopes is only complete with a delicious lunch, a relaxing drink or a great dinner. As a Shiftleader Food & Beverage, you and your team ensure that every guest receives a warm welcome, excellent service and an unforgettable hospitality experience. 
You will be responsible for the daily operational leadership of our teams across our restaurants, terraces, bars and event spaces. You are highly visible on the floor, actively participate in the operation and make sure everything runs smoothly. Together with the Food & Beverage Manager and fellow Shiftleaders, you contribute to a welcoming, professional and efficient F&B operation. 
Every day, you make a difference for our guests and your team. 
What will you do? 
❆ Lead and support the Food & Beverage team during daily operations; 
❆ Coach, motivate and develop employees on the floor; 
